<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis AG H1 results rise.</title>
<headline>Fortis AG H1 results rise.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Belgian francs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS AG --</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share (francs)	  177  vs  151</p>
<p>    Net profit				   6,644  vs   5,389</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands jointly own banking and insurance group Fortis.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
